	(text "24 castellated pads on 1.27 mm, twelve per edge. Pitch chosen\nso the module drops onto 0.1 in perfboard and onto the header\nevery carrier already has.\nPads 5-8 on the right edge are the 1.8 V domain (TXD2, RXD2,\nD_SEL1, D_SEL2). They are NOT 3.3 V tolerant -- VIHmax is\n2.1 V. Each reaches the edge only through a DNP link so the\ndefault board cannot present them to a 3.3 V host by accident."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25 200 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "329c55f2-808a-510b-a07e-275b960b6221")
	)
